# Feedback backend (Firebase) configuration.
#
# The rest of Kathaipoma needs NO environment variables — this file only
# matters for the new Feedback page. Without these set, the Feedback page
# still renders and explains that the backend isn't configured yet; nothing
# else in the app is affected.
#
# 1. Create a free project at https://console.firebase.google.com
# 2. Add a Web App to it, then copy the config values it gives you below.
# 3. Enable Firestore (Build → Firestore Database → Create database).
# 4. Apply the rules in firestore.rules (Firestore → Rules tab) so writes
#    are anonymous, create-only, and can't be read back publicly.
# 5. Copy this file to ".env" (not committed) and fill in the values.
# 6. Restart `npm run dev` after editing .env.

VITE_FIREBASE_API_KEY=
VITE_FIREBASE_AUTH_DOMAIN=
VITE_FIREBASE_PROJECT_ID=
VITE_FIREBASE_STORAGE_BUCKET=
VITE_FIREBASE_MESSAGING_SENDER_ID=
VITE_FIREBASE_APP_ID=
